{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b38765ffd8c67d817d253e0f643c9aa9fbdf79152933765e6584b9a7eb1b002",
      "source_sha256": "30ee2a26ac80172d845937d57d8cab9661e78909515cb74357403ba5b51603c9",
      "translation": "你说，他倒在海边？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a6371d6df01c45a2b51144ec085e27a18121ed4c03170a803b97fafbc2567d7",
      "source_sha256": "97b30a210d8c47bd4769bd8f7a93c9714669e7c184f2756592001fe6ce504f93",
      "translation": "是的。大概是失去记忆了，他对自己的事一无所知。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b682e1d837ace5c4276510f4f867da30c0213d99c02c7afcc2011a82325f0fe",
      "source_sha256": "8d5d03b313cd7a2696cdd0e7169b11cbe3fbc3d9bf4247eaa4d658b47c8de2e1",
      "translation": "看来是被卷入战争后四处流浪，最后来到了我们的岛上。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1877e57094b288b55aac929f77186e587e54c604c65c3d5cc1e87927853cfaa6",
      "source_sha256": "c69c161aa7ef7bf259a9a60442207ccca529fa9970524823e5e44fdbbe6fb79b",
      "translation": "真可怜……不过，竟然能平安来到这里，想必是拉·斯特拉达在庇佑他吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1bdb2997ad3dd84cc1f3868a74a440ed99797352895e2e66f23b9bb586d6d65b",
      "source_sha256": "9a41fdd102f347fb440574716597d41d1a049bb046adb9d5504f233b987b4c18",
      "translation": "你还记得自己的名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9eb1e40935dd8fc90a043d15d734261815d6e2e3aaeef5217a5b4a664df3c3a9",
      "source_sha256": "8827dd7ebb24b92d0d9f6ca370aa9c8e70935cad0ab9ef217478fd8b9eee5301",
      "translation": "这个……完全想不起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:baf6669c66312e575efac9c8b2d685f132b2e6d26f0bc9a693b7ee6985617ce3",
      "source_sha256": "90233baf0c1f92e07f0e384ac897d732d56790898c8013e9e267237f2b51294a",
      "translation": "你说什么啊？我不是说过，从现在起，你就叫“朱特”吗？这么快就忘了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5076a57f263b706d07a19e0b0be9d1085b65d1c9f6d6ab6b54820f723b22f886",
      "source_sha256": "753413744ded0309731aa94a60a1adcedd8a4a068a48c095e9c8f49db4a30abf",
      "translation": "朱特……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:965c6dbdfbbd234ce2d7453b859e7f9ae9d73358b5b767af75ec940336500bd3",
      "source_sha256": "59768c75d0cf10a2bd62c10712b5d0384bc33d9ce1b5417ed11eb70543dfaeac",
      "translation": "呵呵，朱特是这座岛上生长的一种草，生命力非常顽强。无论怎样踩踏，都不会死，依然会坚韧地生长。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7f456f249112b1dd8b11edf10a46c341a00359eca232d0ea8fe6655282e9eaba",
      "source_sha256": "be9175014e6eca994499914d1698ee98bac1ead00193c4d6019811f07bd1cef7",
      "translation": "你给他起了个好名字啊，梅莉莎。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4b5c4c3a903a5e4cba99a397f21087b2058b7178be0628a01b276a94f5b594d7",
      "source_sha256": "5ee5ff380a68f2590405f983003362120dccdd882975b335d592e9495d511ea5",
      "translation": "嗯。希望他能早点恢复健康，所以起了这个名字。而且，这也是我喜欢的一种草。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c884594da3e91487aeebccc1da4eee962169909b3986e8f978ed53810c3032e0",
      "source_sha256": "f96c0ed70ac963ebfc6a55512837f6d7feb345fb62edc5b63e26b8646f0933d6",
      "translation": "总之，朱特，今后就好好相处吧。这座岛很和平，你可以放心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f34dd70d9056becf62afe6c1138653835237cb7ff4a1a46063c3f87cdaa6fcc8",
      "source_sha256": "759d96fd6ad7f7913189c955ee8ffe193dcf485a60f2e37299480c8e70b0624c",
      "translation": "……好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83e8f05be57f27e5daac8d7d5868cbe0529dc9d2da1e9bff1e64af5eb7746f57",
      "source_sha256": "e8af8d10f8998b919393ddebd4224a49470fc58f457ac452202d1bfd050d40be",
      "translation": "朱特，清醒一点。这里是你的梦。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee5ab1f8d2e456062e8560bcfa1e6324d57f94275e8fa462f739e36c3a13f658",
      "source_sha256": "f74a7ed73e2365be8d97171b0e6b093e8c881753052258910392c927cfa445b2",
      "translation": "你……你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07fed8d2774815cfe30111ddfe5079730d22d98b38c1f9b167ed5bb8424f8b33",
      "source_sha256": "817ae72be374f621c0deb02c412d6b90e9a741b1263d4754962efea53950ac79",
      "translation": "喂，小姐。我才是朱特，不是那家伙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c9eb9f0002052c2981b89cd3c0ef14089a65051b19f99e7f5342aa9b80edbb0d",
      "source_sha256": "0621aac8872b6413150a637d361da4887194164378c672e9a543fcdad95786f5",
      "translation": "请你先安静一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a8ddbd5b0ebb3e520229ccf399f104b5d9b0c748750d1a4db096525222d74b6",
      "source_sha256": "8c38ca0a2116021273c9869f1f9d87ea38f0da64446cee7b6f398de86d454cb2",
      "translation": "啧……真爱唠叨。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eb557c44ea0a783eae53e15d7d3c89d9e12e83bef591debf32a00c5d0388df79",
      "source_sha256": "a251f9e5e99d5457ec768461c241600bb0ef7462bbd228faf7eb3cf6e17883bb",
      "translation": "朱特，现在必须回去了。听得懂我的话吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1649c5a089ea38f52ac4cdb41d1581c842577a44c159133de9605961561b74ef",
      "source_sha256": "9af86cf863bdda344f77fcaabd8bc048adbb06a19c136dd2b55408af2210ef25",
      "translation": "不、不要……别靠近我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b1c4d6082a432c0f4703639e869522e806254354a9d0a2c6aeedc62ceb719b61",
      "source_sha256": "23fa64409b011e44f80de13c38bf8d242faf96d7a1c6dbf0477625da698042c6",
      "translation": "朱特？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:674e1c1a482c0d84f8025130b6bfc53643329d4937a185d03da75cad3a5a4f45",
      "source_sha256": "7adacf4899311033d2c2fb81d6483c32167b4483084946784974319fa1383abc",
      "translation": "我要留在这里。别来妨碍我！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:671dc318c9d2a7208fbdfac67067632ff37dd7ce228abe699be2710edeba9ff2",
      "source_sha256": "a33f8169061f6acc25c9154594734ab909a7bc5e4c3f58293ec2f730c001bc22",
      "translation": "没想到，竟然会和朱特战斗……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4267ca42b527bece98ffac1d99de44b0c7ed4dde55d2216b49cdae9f8c013dbd",
      "source_sha256": "ff3691fbc41a80a80b6840e118ee339732e1af08a2463d1892ab827e6d5ca268",
      "translation": "原来，在岛上的时候，朱特是那种感觉啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b990ef2809c7ae7cf440eff390003af84670cb99e8b1e25e567778029908c22b",
      "source_sha256": "59d5b3e238ef7dae7ac077386d6f8c80c1ae81f8088ef05c6235cd5ffc3ccce9",
      "translation": "根本就是个傻瓜。真让人不爽。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:10a196e2c812c6cd37f8d92adb86fcb2f7212a6043a61d02f2f9b68ae7d112df",
      "source_sha256": "ad946ab22cebf0796aab473c48153e6e35859ee16f9c14784cc225cc8ceadf60",
      "translation": "看着自己，居然还能说出这种话……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:81387653fe72dfbc828615ad04966101d3096bf54ac7472b6999535f6d481b0a",
      "source_sha256": "f0989c4822bb670867074c41b159d651d6008d91bcb60d0fec89a5facd22539f",
      "translation": "什么？那真的是我？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be5a3349daf47b7326ca0ac3b7ac7a6e40842918611e70d85f986e198348975f",
      "source_sha256": "611fbbfd1aca24e648f5b937443d5a4e790d1df3d9ec3ae56949c6e8fb71573a",
      "translation": "你们不是长得一模一样吗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5542f809fe1d16cab8306c671f71816dc39e942ba5bbb14c8fa20f3da0e66df1",
      "source_sha256": "58c1fd708aecb4d5d3496c708afa918207b917d7a317bae0713040d113b71f0f",
      "translation": "真让人不爽。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ddeb666b91dd1c37b58031981ee73f381811306b45eab114a6306a1ac35811fc",
      "source_sha256": "3310fd8f59c93e138aaaf44c2f47fcfb4ce137fb26783837b7bf52e14b26ccf9",
      "translation": "有没有想起什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07ac1eaa455df316aa89f98acb3a0dc8ebe689ab09b795edf23705393b97d943",
      "source_sha256": "3f9f9221e4409725b1f1554c800f6025d0f90d9f5837f52386bd1e040d77f9fb",
      "translation": "这个……虽然不想承认，但我也知道，那就是我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fede02f3d97f37cbd37248a9ca65bb018ba4dc134fbad46b9eafafcdc84669a3",
      "source_sha256": "7f625d207b1f9a2ee7afa0976338af3182c35d395f4e937e8d5090f8f64e6723",
      "translation": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b417fca5920c163519794a39cc64d6a419b4896780ddae0d6dbfa918e06351a9",
      "source_sha256": "5ea85b623883e049725fc58c6753f7810f3f93c2bd6ed3f63aadff249daee1c5",
      "translation": "不是，这家伙脑子里到底装了些什么，怎么老是有这种东西冒出来？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:04ab2c168c034770023b7eece1aa3104941bc7e719f8296b7ea1a1e3d8b61400",
      "source_sha256": "bda972e272f097fc5a8075f0f5b6b07fe456019190ebdfe49b5b17b5ff47ae13",
      "translation": "朱特心中的恐惧、害怕和孤独之类的负面情绪，正在不断涌出。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e13799322b57a6c9c913ab6c21570e288ea8da64993584555a74fc1de122c730",
      "source_sha256": "c8c0450de0965fab79215f4460b80305ecf7781ab2740113491105bae5b5e3e7",
      "translation": "如果剖析人的潜意识，每个人都会有这种程度的负面情绪。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3acfbbeb72aba002477164ca145fb70ba2dd2fa91bcb49e62ff73e48f04a1ecd",
      "source_sha256": "35969f2530e6faea42838329993d2ea1b638120607ae4e23f62ab1fab15e5513",
      "translation": "总之，正因为各位在战斗，公主才能平安地接触朱特。所以，请再坚持一下。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c1a7599b0a0fc073ba7c02e176d23ebed0c1bb7f52db44e7473ece0b66ce2d5a",
      "source_sha256": "30f8bc00e93a5cc895003e8ae370ec81dbeee05ca79343b7590b16c40bd91e86",
      "translation": "好，知道了。我真的是看在公主的份上，才忍到现在。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8dda9c844f4ecb222b7d7e39dd5b28abc35cd0267caa2bda719ad1343a8b1584",
      "source_sha256": "50810329b55afd276204f4ee36d1fb7e9e6cfdf84832766a8b7f541f0abfc31c",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔总是在抱怨。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:50c18d985e120fe6ea64a75d2a6fddf01f6cec750d6b59697ac0a66a4e73cefb",
      "source_sha256": "91b51ea3b44da78e23a2fdbad1558fd509b1ba6c2337950e47eeed23f0f9a5ab",
      "translation": "你来试试我的处境啊。这里是水色湿地，几乎产生不了火之KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bb63991f841fd4fcb36b13bf1c1df4808c49a76c8ecdc887ca940bcc47726edb",
      "source_sha256": "375a8b8f7ff98cc06ca88459123d00c3c5ef0aa2bff4aa38fe6c16665cf12d63",
      "translation": "我根本没法好好战斗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9d80ec9fb4ec63786c42af97ce56ec1c4bcd0bc6416acd6c56ee4ed9134fd932",
      "source_sha256": "eaec08dafe3150201f47346e693f4147ae394cdb71f3fcb8b493e177e656df2b",
      "translation": "这种事，靠毅力弥补就好啦～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6273e71c107d9a53034d53939fece968a42e1d069f48dc8227e966602b14ae61",
      "source_sha256": "cea1f8ed393f434873314d87285f4154373e2aa760a9a828a8160f2ba708fd74",
      "translation": "我可不想听你这么说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:efb44f61387e1c696ee9c2d4fc5b5e1167a62cb2a0ad81398465a9e59ccfb0fc",
      "source_sha256": "d40327fbd5109e056a59c6b5ce2b633451c81809d780d72ce186d20333d99c9b",
      "translation": "小心。那些家伙又要来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:09cfb7c98c286e8a6f5c1794a217f2f0600e2d8070b7d5781b2d35e38499ae9a",
      "source_sha256": "e2b0897c26c1a11f2ed85fbae079b11389fd99b183a41333ea9bbee02a91e881",
      "translation": "知道了。来多少都行。……我会把它们全都扫平。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71849a7678a3373b1954aa9acbc5f5e551d3577b19bd75f716d08bd05301cb74",
      "source_sha256": "123737e0b9334279113e6d06e2dd306a0001523565ab91209019a4227fdfa757",
      "translation": "光说不练？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ac397619e04f751fd36400c86a43d35b9af6fa4866f1bd42ba71ac9b94fa73a6",
      "source_sha256": "9253585d51bd842b83c88f7403dee392d4f29f0edc744811afead6b688fd370e",
      "translation": "吵死了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:63226fc46b461dc5e0a44b6b1325daccc29dc7deab11f24a7e8a8dcfe0f267d4",
      "source_sha256": "b33e11d307f0c6cae118808d54620fa30be155dfeadb65c9a9ad2fcbb6f31a97",
      "translation": "看来，公主又跨过了一道难关。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0b095992d89f8a74d32070a1db0ec31f980bb8ad69716d2cf059f1f94a12aa11",
      "source_sha256": "73985688c067befee9a1e43f32cbdef8ed0078035747e4eec18a896d5bfd74ce",
      "translation": "那就稍微休息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35124675b216fed5ee45ab57f3dc93d9c468cc379b71872b6840250e38077805",
      "source_sha256": "85e832a7146125f88882c928d3fbc22de5bcb0ca0b8b5cc4ea43f6098e8aa2b9",
      "translation": "啊！好像又有什么要出来了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:40ec2d78df6f65935df03b3724a7f3f698ba300ba5f29883f1e7fd266666f88c",
      "source_sha256": "3733ebbe7b9dc06f2ef15ef1229aebf93a2de26a325b400f9b02c1c77dc7ce9d",
      "translation": "这次战斗也承蒙您相助，实在感激不尽。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4bd4131982b2347f2f3bd4ee9519775f9eb415cda52ef889d71a9d52a2137c81",
      "source_sha256": "3dfb060d3c4f9ca52070137fef111d9ad6a2d9f6a7ef2cb1829f105598ac9e06",
      "translation": "多亏艾尔加大人，我军才能获胜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:242d2efe4c607a9157394ed1d9f82c23ecec0af0b643fac6a87f6609f52414ca",
      "source_sha256": "47dd1707211c7354d813fcd6c66319369aef44dca3d28aedf2278035f5fb055c",
      "translation": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c7af8c0985507a52679825352bd52974508460c3e8d988c29d6cf254c42d5d65",
      "source_sha256": "d5600004807d2a41c80b985f7b1ef092dca0227adeb4693afb053981b63ed4c1",
      "translation": "喂，那家伙就是艾尔加吧？真让人浑身发冷。幸亏他是我们这边的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dbc1a4c8f4069bfed2cc0433a1f1d87c0a13d2ad2688637115d48e623671e58e",
      "source_sha256": "872470a1aa322d17574813c5e7afdf0d0f62cc841324ffd3a67fca9c915a2a43",
      "translation": "我刚才看到他战斗，也吓得腿都软了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ee0602b610fd7a23cc63bdbc4b9f0eb4be62c5abfc473b361237a37e1034c1a",
      "source_sha256": "f033be1734e532180087f2efa70d014553b99304f5a5dd940b7bdeb858920d76",
      "translation": "真的一瞬间就把人杀了吧？简直就像捏死虫子一样。跟怪物似的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:43c931218551534be1c6067b7581a094f807b97d27146fd388b2184f895b51b9",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:58a4deb673cdb0e9c0318a28927d4bf976ff1716823111b5c432a06cfb8cb02b",
      "source_sha256": "0c7936d104c8b42e986a9ece6db9fbc46827fe265433becc1f4653a0fa08c135",
      "translation": "喂，小声点。他正看着这里呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6728243d95cb7872258a181dd139b55bb5f738074468c86b537de1bb9e71acd9",
      "source_sha256": "8a02bc43c2d9b49fba5fedded36bd782565ae36b4a9df6a4e8763930a2432e55",
      "translation": "什么？快、快去别处吧。小心被劈成两半。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:185d1e2a6d59f92072900264d7a087ff96e53a986a433c00e9a961166a8d07b2",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35b25227a80dbdaee1bf18a1ece254aa991b4bbe2ecb9d8eda596b821dd63301",
      "source_sha256": "e16cb5518f6ffc106255022f0a5e11134875d15d3c80a21bcf0ed3b86efde7ba",
      "translation": "我……是怪物吗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:998ed3fc3102984da938e9345cd6451ee2d7c506621a473745cde705a1531296",
      "source_sha256": "64275f2ecef003ab0e98988a25250379d1fb873d6b4dcb40bd3ca72243f9183a",
      "translation": "既然不喜欢被当成怪物，那别战斗不就好了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6f0d86c871a9ad6b87501513371c8162b19ca87be5b4fe30941653a90d6cc955",
      "source_sha256": "ad515411f8355b6183c96154ec9514f8daa2a114beedbd128930008eb202d731",
      "translation": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e16cc03b34a4805a1fd8cd52ce355b4d08678e1c1592eeb95d8c20577d0c3520",
      "source_sha256": "beb3857561ff6c6931003d3548004eaf220008875c2d69575778147fc8367bb1",
      "translation": "别再被别人的命令摆布了，你这笨蛋。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dd0d466eac56065e4548a83bbf5021508156ecf694b2840709da4782f78f6a8d",
      "source_sha256": "666bedc4a82cac219358a99bbdb977f25559a7147588e03a0203294f3d521bc5",
      "translation": "朱特，虽然无法改变过去，但你能跨越这段过去，变得更坚强。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ecd389e903f5134dda1444ccf7224d362a588fd31e4e769758acccbd7d222ef7",
      "source_sha256": "71f96a3c90a2782545245f85dd63f3d78bf536f06a0466467c0d858a220ac4d5",
      "translation": "事实上，你也确实做到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cf411f01defac150ad0e4ff3b3b6f15e3f0fad41dcf547c99d204a67a1ee6c1e",
      "source_sha256": "9e4bcbf1e685e1aea3ead75124a79a0f7144f44f599b22f5b51de1f48b0fd5bb",
      "translation": "难道是蕾洁菲尔妲公主？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eacff9d6dc5314220d977bbdb5af7686e70b5c0b73ee77fb695a28de54424546",
      "source_sha256": "99fedcb3265a5750d3c80895d0d7ac5d713c413fb1f7efd18c9c577b2d007503",
      "translation": "呃……别过来……别到我这里来！我没有杀你！！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c04ca709650a6334afd29a15eeff8a3284e30cb7039b1f96e7e6b6d2f64528e4",
      "source_sha256": "b665b6fbd876339ad0ea1815fbcd25b3681f390dd1f79b4136b534ed1a10e041",
      "translation": "我、我没有违抗主人的命令……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5505ec284adf075a5fdad940a9764e9ea4da28bbb63d222e318e0517c29ee135",
      "source_sha256": "13519dc048e8ef444de1c879545edf3ca37a820babfc2fe9a0e7a08d22ab12b7",
      "translation": "那种家伙竟然是我，真让人无语。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bdb088f123ac6949e6d6bf2a8005031dd9c68d8799b89fbf755d5d0df216c00c",
      "source_sha256": "cd8f9654e12364cf79a1c2cb26073d267e9d209b3f746bdd2101efac28e11751",
      "translation": "别过来……我会把你们全都杀掉！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8d51b4eb5def4f04f949f2e36cd04ca9599b037e264e03c7de2b9ce1ee73e254",
      "source_sha256": "77417f89f37517840e0aa1830c957461e6094714e6360dd0d728ecc54d6970f1",
      "translation": "看来，没法沟通。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71a3a7f129b917cb9c2213a1e16572ae2c03abdad671a22c7f61e102fae6c76a",
      "source_sha256": "dfd25b5bb2a3ee7d9a9fb56bc9ccbb3ac97cdfb86135351f6c4d8532090a9a0c",
      "translation": "果然，只能战斗了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9b87a310e10ae90a375eb4809f1c757351dcffa7bf55ee334e305cac97c797fe",
      "source_sha256": "2219b43c1919c7a6c5da574c44808fb6e5552c57baa1143fc5844cf8023edeb6",
      "translation": "看起来有点寂寞……原来，艾尔加有着那样的眼神。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:01fe6d111ad8ad13d3db8db935d63b991e5a3987f50fdf90505ce8ea93422523",
      "source_sha256": "ab52b23254debcd1fc5ad3fa8da5960bcdcd2b4a99538bcc25c545efd8b9eec4",
      "translation": "我？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a867d35cb659fd251ac0e27ad32e5473ddda0ca415c16de6dd961cb3080546f",
      "source_sha256": "9d4eb322147c4e1c2a11755b60e48cbe00ac3536dd1bf412b87f786d3d276f6f",
      "translation": "不，不是说你……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:786e6fb7da110a41c22b3f79d25017d7a405a886e9d592b24383973881568e63",
      "source_sha256": "777d8fefd35105a54548c1570d6a4a90615ec5a46e2ccaa993707268a6812789",
      "translation": "即便如此，我还是无法原谅艾尔加。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a2aa91d13a682c4e7cd2152a4c11c7ad39ab923c224713ff93a945075d2f621",
      "source_sha256": "83a06209ad890f80fe902a4e6126b74ad6eb4db90e334049c342fd78ef6bb5da",
      "translation": "那个人差点就杀死了公主。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7e18ddad3f0844327c438fe5b358307f160b819034a71b66c8163f3a40824862",
      "source_sha256": "676a6d8a6a8261355ec2dbc2625d6842d91fa8a63d816ae94e0f2f0d2024c73b",
      "translation": "我也无法原谅艾尔加所做的事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:52518975834f865596b3a30d42a05350207ea6551389c42bd26ebb511437c403",
      "source_sha256": "916c17a35e5600621ecb56fbc4d5332942c8ae100ccee7855298c9594e76ad72",
      "translation": "只是……我认为，朱特和艾尔加不一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7860506443dbdae6f3f200fe46a6870ce5949bcf3af19e10b34022df95fc43a7",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c5b3f13004d4bf32637456bc729bee51b2e614b09f0a83b36fd95491b1040ab2",
      "source_sha256": "8776290fc0b9189441caf0779061de045171d27f42da0f79f7d6b5af95dbdb8c",
      "translation": "嗯，那就继续走吧？接下来，又会和谁战斗呢？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0a1a46f5cd3297793a91185b7cf3f5749f2ca8d7b4773387c00a00e43732f18",
      "source_sha256": "df38cf122454b5cd99325888c129dcb18be2c1e40cf69a5e7cbb6706b8d4b683",
      "translation": "就算失去了记忆，也未免太悠闲了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5475f0af5a214ecde245c6d3c400d6c65a4d7935b57c75b8c01e1bbee3b9f315",
      "source_sha256": "2bf4093d0345e259ccb52ccbafb357128812cdb1f131d5e27cef0dd018a1982f",
      "translation": "现在，这可是你自己的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e98aa4478cb9b084a2d75b8292424b25f896612c150f0542c0b40b6af5eb6936",
      "source_sha256": "cd118f30e7d490a3884f10776678dac288536a7f2eebc27cf34bb42191ef1b44",
      "translation": "公主不是为了别人，正是为了救你才来的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0cd278dc44eb51a5df1743501a8e744eff6b5ced53b45e4f324aedb880303350",
      "source_sha256": "3333622b877068fbf9edb0b226bce5da23b7265d9141b4da15a0799d4b439d76",
      "translation": "好了，露。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8ec744a3e07667f30a559ca6ef687be68e218cf67274edc4429b23168b0fdd9",
      "source_sha256": "5bb994604c1a90119c055a5adeccdceb481cc603349750a83585aee2148c336a",
      "translation": "朱特什么都不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4244553167f32e81858f0a7934d9c7a2a22a490dcfeaa6b921b299cc89c8ca13",
      "source_sha256": "4e02d0d758b8e3d9833474dacf5169e706093a020899c5a0cd6b229f658af29a",
      "translation": "希望这次就是最后了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:32a28caffaba9a4e2ea5766a98a90ef6f8800031adf388307bb0c95c5ed86e82",
      "source_sha256": "e28ebebdaa916e7804c7e19100a42a4c6adfcc3809d63e007ab46bf9cebe2352",
      "translation": "我也希望如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6fb17cde9af671ec9e9a3e75089f55466391e3feeffbcaf4cf52549aa404cbd3",
      "source_sha256": "d932f6758fb231f98e97c33ec7c05dd579f0f3cdea195053e064c01a67b92177",
      "translation": "大家做好准备。必须保护洁菲，直到最后！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:92a0a04a9b188f518c8341115150fa4aeacbe312232def790d2fb40f6b0b12df",
      "source_sha256": "2a37ee8c957ec40a1175099afe55e8073cd149ef3c03f045d58c3d8940f62695",
      "translation": "结束了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:37d13176acdca038bc5ca561b5fa79a2eae6d9e54dfe8ba66eb4790ea44c4c29",
      "source_sha256": "0175b4634016899c7e34c8056db98e060c7998108d9f832ee2bc6625d705bf84",
      "translation": "嗯。看来，我们这边已经结束了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f8a296e8392b268086a856ab9d0a7f86a70a18c3beda5daa2bbfa4c89a92dedf",
      "source_sha256": "a2f7c72e17dea4856fa8c2f80fa37ea2f5acaeeeba3907017974ec41596f7bf6",
      "translation": "现在只能期待公主和露顺利了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d990709569949be33f284d7fa370994936ad187d03b6ec3c8192c775f20442e1",
      "source_sha256": "ed09fd14b2c2d29b3976be1e1bc111b93ac74cd29bfe1d20f65d44b53d488283",
      "translation": "洁菲姐姐，一定要带着朱特哥哥，平安回来啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be11724d68fc8d23397ae215ea329acf88901c1b3181c17ce34e7f1882d9d51c",
      "source_sha256": "787a4d7f9ecba7b18c53ed907382cc625d7693010b2d736059749eec9d4a2e13",
      "translation": "水色湿地的阿尔戈一行……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9ba723339d4649ce28e77e7a43367a31c8b3af19231288d483df4387f65c29bc",
      "source_sha256": "b77579b14e937f5c7b0bfe3a4e49e74d3199c604335f6785439f4a8fd3f97a14",
      "translation": "与此同时，洁菲一行……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:69c71210b0085882cfa6ce23e6315ca4c6bd20530d8a884ccb894ee0305fb15c",
      "source_sha256": "f5e281e9e704b9625f2b24c4f535ac245db022028eed90d2654b70a0d50d9697",
      "translation": "同一时刻，水色湿地……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1a5e0d1057f9721edfbb0f484aa87934780f1daa70d87e48eb1a33078c7688df",
      "source_sha256": "7726cec4fd4e45f32d68162157ec280562cbc1223bb84f3e7260c28fa73c834f",
      "translation": "在朱特的精神世界里……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f98be623a237389a4268836f659a1f4d69f6a7c3a430727deee44ac747fa914d",
      "source_sha256": "d8de3c4cbbb105fec948d0b7f51b07f9ecb7e480bfbeabca81b443fb24d5842d",
      "translation": "嗯……毕竟，我们受过你们不少帮助……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae534c7e3a059fde760a6ed9ae231527c8f6b7316a82ff1504f5b7021bf0ad26",
      "source_sha256": "34cf679fdd850e8cd394e36b9bf046e6daceec1900b31b3b63dabc2954d48a8d",
      "translation": "虽然不好开口骂你们，可还是没办法毫无反感。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:333789416316eb0054c29ee62044028933d9e371e33409cc3c581202db341617",
      "source_sha256": "47151b9de74cca96b089e8178b7d19f045fa65c6498f89dc8166ee26eb41054a",
      "translation": "听说，公主率领的部队都是叛徒？哼，赶快滚吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:01124041146dad8188fd9f2d1998a9d15395ee6fc9e6ac7cec45669fcfc1cb24",
      "source_sha256": "4cf0f1586ae4ceaedf832e1dfcd990b206e90bf661bf6435bf7af27f7e2d4d20",
      "translation": "看起来不像传闻里那么凶恶……人真是不可貌相。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f392f227aadb67c63020603afb198b12d9c06e46b5d4d090492a96ed244d02ec",
      "source_sha256": "9af10423eb64a1869f04380a37875a889a3f8e29b1324d05baa0374217a040cf",
      "translation": "如今这个世道，连吃饭过日子都这么艰难，也都是你们害的！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:486ae59384dbb8d5140e36cf6bcef6dc302a05506347eb542db52fa940c2e4fc",
      "source_sha256": "7d3b19ff9f8bc0df8bbc246900ab5a576ef3f0c3111272b5270e250694654860",
      "translation": "听说，公主在人类那边挨骂了喵。发生什么事了喵？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e7e35519a7d65be0778cfbd225ac0640c065e25f0852d409559bb44b9a45f9dd",
      "source_sha256": "0a926c0a7c11fdd41feda7defd4710dad020e7f27bd085b67924696d6e504177",
      "translation": "猫猫和人类没关系，随时都可以来玩喵～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14d2a74c64c26eec7e0ece51085a7adeb0ac9228cd83e60d85503998d10c4317",
      "source_sha256": "2fe08cfeefb882d2900bb296c74ae7d46b4da471b200a42879264024758ae911",
      "translation": "不知道什么时候才能恢复航行喵。又说什么南部军变成了联军，忙得不可开交之类的～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cc7049352e5bf265dcf7d440e83ef329790037a9de0bd142a9c59dbbf727a4b8",
      "source_sha256": "1a19753254692b33f00f567fd5750af1ed2e72d0154c3bd484aa72d3594c8a41",
      "translation": "听说，港口管理暂时歇业了喵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:da49aecd47712eae15455770f2998468b8f543d862e2cf12caed70a462070ab1",
      "source_sha256": "e0e3d791a2083e5a7eecc2f2fcf2da4251e23381aa5d45dc2592b859db7e9d16",
      "translation": "阿维斯运输队开始经营港口业务，方便多了喵～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fa8fced8bb17987d78eb0d34719b06a4a6127adf7fba6b2072abc35c0eedb63c",
      "source_sha256": "63f06cdd5b34f4499710ec94e9a85a27a802ed6b4676772e6d7696be894278fc",
      "translation": "南部军委托保管军需品的业务，突然就断了喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59e7fb9ba44afa1c24daffbd2e37277fb2a1c4bff7ef38ae5072b947b250cb45",
      "source_sha256": "976468136981b107a0cf62807b82d809e36e4aacdce7fd366371f6e012c80368",
      "translation": "人类的战争，这次真的要结束了喵？猫猫可还在打仗喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
